        "A 401 from the **comment gate** carries `UNAUTHORIZED`, like every other 401 on the API — today it invents `AUTH_REQUIRED`, a synonym the published union does not list",
        "A webhook refusing the request **method** carries `METHOD_NOT_ALLOWED` on its 405 — today it ships `BAD_REQUEST`, which tells the caller to fix a payload that is not the problem",
