        "Every other `404` — the admin, AI, analytics, auth, buckets, OpenAPI and automation roads, a member denied a route, and an `/api/*` path no route matches — answers the same shape: `{ success: false, error: \"Not Found\", message, code: \"NOT_FOUND\" }`, with `message` free to name what was not found",
