        "`GET /api/auth/oauth2/authorize` with `code_challenge_method=plain` returns `error=invalid_request` (S256 only)",
        "The full PKCE-S256 authorization-code flow exchanges a code for an access token at `/api/auth/oauth2/token` (with `id_token` if `openid` scope)",
        "Introspecting an issued access token (RFC 7662) returns `active=true` with `sub` matching `auth.user.id` and `client_id` echoed",
        "`POST /api/auth/oauth2/revoke` (RFC 7009) revokes an access token; subsequent introspection returns `active=false`",
        "When `app.auth` is NOT configured, OAuth-server endpoints return 404 (plugin not mounted)",
        "`GET /.well-known/openid-configuration` returns the OIDC 1.0 discovery doc with `userinfo_endpoint` populated",
