        "A standalone `phone`, `datetime` or `attachment` field on a hosted form draws its own control — a telephone input, a date-time picker and a file picker, named `input`, `date-picker` and `file-upload` — and the file picker takes a file",
        "A relationship on a form that requires a signed-in visitor offers her only the related rows the row-level rule shows her, as the records API lists them",
